flowchart TD
    A[Local logs under C:\AI_Repo\logs] --> T[Triage]
    T --> S[Diagnostic supervisor / ReAct]
    S --> O[Read-only logs, metrics, source, changes]
    S --> C[Confluence MCP reference]
    S --> R[RAG: reviewed incidents only]
    O --> E[Evidence catalog with IDs]
    C --> E
    R --> E
    E --> S
    S --> H[Up to 3 hypotheses]
    H --> B[Bounded branch investigators]
    B --> K[Critic / evaluator]
    K --> G{Automated evidence gate}
    G -- need evidence and budget remains --> S
    G -- ready or escalate --> U[Human interrupt]
    U -- reject --> X[Final; no admission]
    U -- confirm/correct + remediation --> M[(CockroachDB trusted vector memory)]
    M --> R
    P[(CockroachDB LangGraph checkpoints)] --- T
    P --- S
